    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare</em></p><p>This bellows has 6 charges. While holding it, you can take a Magic action and speak one of three command words to produce one of the following effects:</p><p><strong>First Command Word.</strong> You expend 1 charge to make the bellows draw the energy out of one creature you can see within 60 feet. The creature must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or have the Incapacitated condition for 1 minute. It repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p><p><strong>Second Command Word.</strong> You expend 3 charges to make the bellows draw the energy out of the creatures in a 30-foot Cone. Each creature there must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or have the Incapacitated condition for 1 minute. An affected creature repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p><p><strong>Third Command Word.</strong> You expend 5 charges to cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCloudkill0]{Cloudkill} (save DC 17) from the bellows.</p><p><strong>Regaining Charges.</strong> The item regains 1d6 + 1 expended charges daily at dawn. If you expend its last charge, roll [[/r 1d20]]. On a 1, the bellows bursts in a harmless gust of wind and is lost forever.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-qDbWpQ5uSF1IhkLh\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Une créature Neutralisée refait le jet de Constitution DD 15 à la fin de chacun de ses tours : retirez l’effet sur une réussite.</p></section>",
